# D323: compare the binary64 bits read from fixed-width GRO fields
# with Python's independent decimal conversion. The existing velocity test
# checks rejected fields and their line-level diagnostics.
# REQUIRES: python-api
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_gro_decimals.py %t | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: 1536 coordinate and velocity fields equal the decimal oracle bitwise
# CHECK: malformed coordinate retains its line-level diagnostic
